stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> WAITING: leader joins queue
  WAITING --> CALLED: scheduler calls the next team
  CALLED --> CHECKING_IN: members verify location
  CHECKING_IN --> READY_TO_PLAY: leader confirms ready
  CALLED --> MISSED_QUEUE: deadline passes
  CHECKING_IN --> MISSED_QUEUE: deadline passes
  READY_TO_PLAY --> PLAYING: both teams ready
  PLAYING --> DECIDING_CONTINUE: valid result, team won
  PLAYING --> DECIDING_REQUEUE: valid result, team lost
  PLAYING --> CANCELLED: no valid scores in 5 min
  DECIDING_CONTINUE --> HOLDING_COURT: continue (first win)
  HOLDING_COURT --> PLAYING: next challenger ready
  PLAYING --> RESTING: second consecutive win
  RESTING --> WAITING: one game rested, back to the head
  DECIDING_REQUEUE --> WAITING: requeue at the end
  DECIDING_CONTINUE --> LEFT_QUEUE: leave or 3 min pass
  DECIDING_REQUEUE --> LEFT_QUEUE: leave or 3 min pass
  WAITING --> LEFT_QUEUE: leader leaves
  MISSED_QUEUE --> [*]
  LEFT_QUEUE --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
